# Links the link checker must not fail on. Each line is a regular expression
# matched against the URL.

# The generated Dart API reference only exists once 1.1.0 is published.
https://pub.dev/documentation/ix_flutter/latest/

# The wiki is a one-way sync target; it may not exist yet.
https://github.com/SobSoft-s-r-o/ix_flutter/wiki

# npmjs.com answers 403 to non-browser clients; the package itself is verified
# through the registry API instead (see UPSTREAM.md for its checksum).
https://www.npmjs.com/

# Pages added in the 1.1.0 line: the package README and the notices link to
# them absolutely (they ship to pub.dev, where relative links do not resolve),
# so they only answer once this line is merged into main. Drop these two lines
# with that merge.
https://github.com/SobSoft-s-r-o/ix_flutter/blob/main/UPSTREAM\.md
https://github.com/SobSoft-s-r-o/ix_flutter/blob/main/doc/(theming|density|typography|tokens)\.md
